WEBVTT

00:15:28.496 --> 00:15:30.579
and not what happens to us,

00:15:30.579 --> 00:15:33.412
but how we respond to what happens to us.

00:15:33.454 --> 00:15:34.621
"This,"

00:15:34.621 --> 00:15:36.454
wrote the psychiatrist Viktor Frankl,

00:15:36.454 --> 00:15:38.162
"is the last of the human freedoms:

00:15:38.162 --> 00:15:41.496
to choose one's attitude
in any given set of circumstances."

00:15:42.704 --> 00:15:43.871
I wished to tell him

00:15:43.912 --> 00:15:47.704
that not only paralyzers
and paralyzees must evolve,

00:15:47.704 --> 00:15:49.454
reconcile to reality,

00:15:49.496 --> 00:15:51.246
but we all must --

00:15:51.246 --> 00:15:53.371
the aging and the anxious

00:15:53.412 --> 00:15:56.329
and the divorced and the balding

00:15:56.329 --> 00:15:58.954
and the bankrupt and everyone.